=2026-06-17/part-00000.parquet - | parquet-tools schema -\n   ```\n   Verify that `amount` is listed as `double` (or `decimal` if you changed it) and that the row count","sequence":0,"stepIndex":3,"turnId":"turn_0"},"type":"message.appended","meta":{"at":"2026-06-18T16:46:15.737Z"}}
